    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**What this dashboard answers:** which queries to Mem0 found nothing (or found less than expected), and why.\n\n* Every `/search`, `/retrieve` and `/query` call writes one `query_event` JSON line to the `mem0-server` stdout; Alloy ships it to Loki. Use the **project / agent_id / user_id / endpoint** variables (multi-select, default *All*) to narrow down.\n* **True miss** = `hits=0` and the request was *not* degraded: the stores answered and truly had nothing. Action: the memory is missing, was stored under another scope/user/agent, or the query wording does not match. Check the *filters* and *scopes* of the event, then look in the CMS. For `/query` events, `candidates>0` means results existed but the score threshold (`min_score_memory`) filtered them out.\n* **Partial miss** = `lexical=0`, `hits>0` and not degraded: only semantic search found something. Action: keyword/BM25 coverage gap (rare terms, identifiers, language mismatch).\n* **Zero-hit while degraded** = `hits=0` and a retrieval stage was unavailable (see `degradation_reasons`). Hard backend failures on `/search` and `/retrieve` also appear here, with the exception type as reason. Do **not** treat it as missing knowledge: fix the failing stage first (embedder, reranker, vector store) and re-run the query.\n* A blank `lexical`/`semantic`/`rerank` cell means that stage did not run or did not report a count.\n* The time range picker applies to every panel. Columns are sortable and filterable; click a cell to filter.\n\n**Privacy:** the `query` and `filters` columns contain raw query text. Anyone with Grafana access can read them (Grafana runs with anonymous Admin). Retention is 14 days."
      },
      "transparent": false
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Summary",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Zero-hit rate",
      "description": "Share of query events in the selected time range that returned 0 hits (true misses + zero-hit while degraded) divided by all query events. Read it as: 'how often does an agent come back empty-handed'. Green < 10%, yellow 10-30%, red > 30% (rough guidelines, tune to your traffic). A rising value with a flat true-miss count points to degradation; see the 'Zero-hit while degraded' panel.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "noValue": "0",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.3
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(count_over_time({service=\"mem0-server\",event=\"query_event\",endpoint=~\"$endpoint\",project=~\"$project\",agent_id=~\"$agent_id\",user_id=~\"$user_id\"} | json hits=\"hits\" | hits=0 | __error__=\"\" [$__range])) or vector(0)) / sum(count_over_time({service=\"mem0-server\",event=\"query_event\",endpoint=~\"$endpoint\",project=~\"$project\",agent_id=~\"$agent_id\",user_id=~\"$user_id\"} [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
